Z||000013||Nick||08-30-99||06:18 AM||||Well, fast is a relative term.  Have you ever owned a CRX Si?  Well if not then you probably shouldn't make that kind of a statement.  I on the other hand own a CRX Si and until last week an 86 Fiero GT.  As far as the CRX not being any good in the slalom, according to Motor Trend magazine they were very close to the slalom numbers of the Fiero(except maybe the 88 GT).  So I guess I don't understand what you're basing your statement on.  It sounds like you're basing it off of one incident on the freeway with some idiot in a CRX who obviously didn't know how to drive.<p>Yes the new Civic Si runs the quarter in mid to high 15's.  Unless you have some mods, they will probably take you in the quarter.
